The materials in this repository are demonstration editions pressed with
Torchio (https://github.com/emmcarbe/torchio, MIT). Each edition's contents
remain under the licence of their source, recorded per edition in README.md
("Materials and rights"): CC BY-SA, CC BY-NC-SA, GPL 2.0, GPL 3.0, or
copyright by invitation of the editors. The GPL editions carry the licence
text in their own COPYING files (sources/romualdo, sources/orso, and the
pressed sites). No single licence covers the whole repository: the per-
edition declaration governs.
